      "side": 1,
      "message": "the phrasing here doesn\u0027t quite feel right. You\u0027re not really overriding compatConfig. Maybe \"applyTo\" would be better?\n\nOr maybe better again would be:\n\n  compatConfig.addOverrides(OverridesBuilder.create().....build())\n\nThat makes the method your testing visible (addOverrides()) which is currently obfuscated in here, making it hard to understand which functionality your actually testing (it looks a bit like the test if for OverridesBuilder)",
