      "writtenOn": "2019-12-17T18:00:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "not sure changing the build type mid-test makes sense? Those things are fixed at build time, so it would be reasonable (for example) for these values to be cached in the prod code which would break this test. Better to move this case into a separate test method?\n\n(also makes me wonder whether we should always allow removing of overrides? Image installing a debuggable app -\u003e apply overrides -\u003e upgrade to non-debuggable app -\u003e try to remove override - would that work as expected? Or do we remove overrides at upgrade time in that case?)",
